Data availability

            The datasets of ERA5 monthly reanalysis data of single-level and pressure-levels variables are archived at https://doi.org/10.24381/cds.f17050d7 and https://doi.org/10.24381/cds.6860a573, respectively. The monthly CESM1 large ensemble simulation data are available at https://doi.org/10.5065/D6J101D1. The CMIP6 data are available at https://esgf-node.llnl.gov/search/cmip6/. The output of LBM experiments is available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21500988 (ref. 51). Source data are provided with this paper.
          Code availability

            The scripts used to perform the diagnostic analysis and visualization are based on NCAR Command Language (NCL) version 6.6.2 and Python 3.11.6 and are publicly available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21500988 (ref. 51).
